    "seoTitle": "Why People Obey Authority: Milgram, Conformity and Power",
    "metaDescription": "Understand obedience, Milgram’s experiments, conformity, manipulation and resistance, with scientific evidence and the limits of famous studies.",
    "excerpt": "Understand obedience, Milgram’s experiments, conformity, manipulation and resistance, with scientific evidence and the limits of famous studies.",
